t(j, t[:120])\nEOF"},"output":"=== page 5\n0 TABLE OF CONTENTS\n1 TABLE OF CONTENTS\n2 Page\n3 SUMMARY\n4 1\n5 QUESTIONS AND ANSWERS ABOUT THE SPECIAL MEETING AND THE MERGER\n6 10\n7 CAUTIONARY STATEMENT CONCERNING FORWARD-LOOKING STATEMENTS\n8 15\n9 THE PARTIES TO THE MERGER AGREEMENT\n10 16\n11 PetSmart, Inc.\n12 16\n13 Argos Holdings, Inc. and Argos Merger Sub\n14 16\n15 THE SPECIAL MEETING\n16 17\n17 Date, Time and Place of the Special Meeting\n18 17\n19 Purpose of the Special Meeting\n20 17\n21 Recommendation of the Company’s Board of Directors\n22 17\n23 Record Date and Quorum\n24 17\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== page 5\n0 TABLE OF CONTENTS\n1 TABLE OF CONTENTS\n2 Page\n3 SUMMARY\n4 1\n5 QUESTIONS AND ANSWERS ABOUT THE SPECIAL MEETING AND THE MERGER\n6 10\n7 CAUTIONARY STATEMENT CONCERNING FORWARD-LOOKING STATEMENTS\n8 15\n9 THE PARTIES TO THE MERGER AGREEMENT\n10 16\n11 PetSmart, Inc.\n12 16\n13 Argos Holdings, Inc. and Argos Merger Sub\n14 16\n15 THE SPECIAL MEETING\n16 17\n17 Date, Time and Place of the Special Meeting\n18 17\n19 Purpose of the Special Meeting\n20 17\n21 Recommendation of the Company’s Board of Directors\n22 17\n23 Record Date and Quorum\n24 17\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Command exited with code 0."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/uctpiaj/work && python3 << 'EOF'\\nfrom bs4 import BeautifulSoup, NavigableString, Tag\\nimport re, json\\n\\nwith open('raw_filing/petsmart_2015-02-02_DEFM14A.htm', 'r', encoding='utf-8', errors='replace') as f:\\n    html = f.read()\\n\\nsoup = BeautifulSoup(html, 'lxml')\\nbody = soup.body\\npages = [d for d in body.find_all('div', recursive=True) if 'page-break-after' in (d.get('style') or '')]\\n\\nINLINE = {'font','a','span','b','i','u','em','strong','sup','sub','br','small','big','nobr','wbr','img','strike','s','ins','del','code','abbr','cite','q','mark','time','var','kbd','samp','tt','underline','center','hr'}\\n# 'center','hr' are actually block. Remove hr/center from inline.\\nINLINE = {'font','a','span','b','i','u','em','strong','sup','sub','br','small','big','nobr','wbr','img','strike','s','ins','del','code','abbr','cite','q','mark','time','var','kbd','samp','tt','underline'}\\n\\ndef collect_units(root, units):\\n    # if root has element children all inline -> unit = full text\\n    elems = [c for c in root.children if isinstance(c, Tag)]\\n    noninline = [c for c in elems if c.name not in INLINE]\\n    if not noninline:\\n        t = root.get_text(' ', strip=True).replace('\\\\u200b','').strip()\\n        t = re.sub(r'\\\\s+', ' ', t)\\n        if t:\\n            units.append((root, t))\\n        return\\n    for c in noninline:\\n        collect_units(c, units)\\n\\nall_pages = []\\nfor pi, page in enumerate(pages):\\n    units = []\\n    collect_units(page, units)\\n    all_pages.append(units)\\n\\n# print page idx 7 units\\nfor pi in [5]:\\n    print(\\\"=== page\\\", pi)\\n    for j,(node,t) in enumerate(all_pages[pi][:25]):\\n        print(j, t[:120])\\nEOF\"}"},"time":{"start":1789824321059,"end":1789824322965}}}}
