{"type":"text","timestamp":1789824836715,"sessionID":"ses_f4628fb5effez2Rp2Ib8TcXtcB","part":{"id":"prt_0b9df99f1001mDg0apmCsnUatU","sessionID":"ses_f4628fb5effez2Rp2Ib8TcXtcB","messageID":"msg_0b9da44e8001vibt3lOkJy3li9","type":"text","text":"I have the full picture now. Before building, here is my proposed structure and the main uncertainties (per the instruction, I'm continuing without waiting for a reply):\n\n**Proposed process/round structure**\n- **Process 1** (single sale attempt, no prior attempt): exploration decision Aug 13, 2014 → signing Dec 14, 2014; closing not observed in the filing.\n- **Round 0**: pre-opening phases — June 18 board review, JPM retention, JANA/Longview activism, Industry Participant approaches (Aug 7–27).\n- **Round 1** opens at the first target-organized step admitting participants — the confidentiality/standstill wave with 15 financial buyers in the first week of October 2014 (rejected anchor candidates: Aug 13 decision, Aug 19 press release, Aug 27 Industry Participant contact, Oct 30 IOI deadline). 15 entrants → 9 inferred non-submitters at the Oct 30 IOI deadline → 6 submitters → 4 advanced Nov 3.\n- **Round 2** (final round) opens Nov 3, 2014 with four bidders at/above $80; two combine as \"Bidder 3\" (units 4→3); final bids Dec 10 (revised from Dec 5), improved/best-and-final bids Dec 12; board approval Dec 13; signing Dec 14. Finality: Announced as final. No post-signing competition, no go-shop, no closing observed.\n\n**Consequential uncertainties to be flagged in Questions**\n1. The filing says \"six\" IOI submitters (Background) but \"5 bidder groups\" (Reasons) — I keep six parties and reconcile.\n2. How many final-round bidders combined into Bidder 3 and the resulting unit count (4→3 reading fit to the December record).\n3. The 9 non-submitters residual assumes all six submitters were among the 15 signers.\n4. Deadline treatments (Dec 5→Dec 10 → Extended; Dec 10→Dec 12 improved bids → Extended; Dec 12 Enforced).\n5. Conditions levels for the preliminary IOIs (Insufficient evidence) and final bids (Light, committed financing).","time":{"start":1789824834033,"end":1789824836715}}}
