  quotes=[('P-010','Industry Participant would have interest in discussing the possibility of a combination','the board would consider it')],\\n   src=['P-010'], review='Q5', count=0,\\n   df=d(2014,8,27), dt=d(2014,8,27), wd=d(2014,8,27), basis='Reported day', method='Reported',\\n   page=23, related='R008; R010', deal='PetSmart'),\\n dict(id='R016', when='first week of October 2014', who='PetSmart / J.P. Morgan (process)',\\n   what='Round opened', round=1,\\n   terms='R1 anchor: confidentiality and standstill agreements with 15 financial buyers, first week of October 2014. Rejected candidate anchors: R009 (08/13 sale decision), R013 (08/19 press release), R008/R015 (Industry Participant contacts), R019–R020 (10/30 IOI deadline). No target outreach wave is reported (parties came to the target after the 08/19 announcement), so Round 1 opens at the first target-organized step that admits participants. Round finality: Not final — only non-binding preliminary indications of interest were solicited; no finality announcement.',\\n   reason='Convention (boundary): per section 6.3 anchor order. The NDA wave is the earliest target-organized admission step (the October process letter carrying the IOI deadline came later).',\\n   quotes=[('P-013','In the first week of October 2014, the Company entered into confidentiality and standstill agreements','management presentations involving the Company\\\\u2019s senior-most management'),\\n           ('P-011','J.P. Morgan was contacted by 27 potential participants in a sale process','and 24 financial participants')],\\n   src=['P-013','P-011'], review='Q1', count=None,\\n   df=d(2014,10,1), dt=d(2014,10,7), wd=d(2014,10,1), basis='Reported interval', method='Assigned: bound',\\n   finality='Not final', page=23, related='R009; R013; R019; R020', deal='PetSmart'),\\n dict(id='R017', when='first week of October 2014', who='15 potentially interested financial buyers (cohort)',\\n   what='NDA signed', round=1, type='Financial',\\n   terms='15 financial buyers executed confidentiality and standstill agreements with the Company (new signatures; no reused agreements identified). All 15 engaged in due diligence during October, received management presentations involving senior-most management, and received detailed financial and business plan information including the Profit Improvement Plan and cost-saving plans. Standstills prevent them from submitting (or seeking permission to submit) a higher bid once the Company entered a definitive agreement with the winning process participant. Count 15.',\\n   reason='Stated. Uniform stage access is stated on this admission row, not as separate information-access rows. Auction screen: more than one independent prospective acquiring bidder unit signed (met).',\\n   quotes=[('P-013','all 15 of which, during the month of October engaged in due diligence','detailed information concerning the Profit Improvement Plan and associated cost-saving plans and opportunities'),\\n           ('X-009','standstill provisions that prevent those parties from submitting','once the Company entered into a definitive transaction agreement with the winning sale process participant')],\\n   src=['P-013','X-009'], review='Q4', count=15,\\n   df=d(2014,10,1), dt=d(2014,10,7), wd=d(2014,10,1), basis='Reported interval', method='Assigned: bound',\\n   page=23, related='R016; R021', deal='PetSmart'),\\n dict(id='R018', when='10/03/2014', who='PetSmart board (with management, J.P. Morgan and Wachtell Lipton)',\\n   what='Target decision', round=1,\\n   terms='Board received a process update: approximately 15 parties had expressed interest; reviewed communications with the 27 potential participants and Industry Participant; reaffirmed the determination not to invite Industry Participant to the process.',\\n   reason='Stated. The relative order of this meeting and the NDA wave start is not stated; the NDA-wave rows are placed first under the section 8.1 order convention (see Q8).',\\n   quote